{"2962340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Department of Collections", "steam_appid": 2962340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Message from DOC</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Y</i></strong>ou are an employee <strong><i>o</i></strong>f the Department of Collections. Yo<strong><i>u</i></strong> <strong><i>a</i></strong>re required to complete tasks in orde<strong><i>r</i></strong> to progr<strong><i>e</i></strong>ss. Along the way you will find scraps and unique items to help you on your mission, v<strong><i>e</i></strong>ry little will be provided to you by DOC. Everything must be earned and we e<strong><i>x</i></strong>pect com<strong><i>p</i></strong>lianc<strong><i>e</i></strong>.  You'll find puzzles alo<strong><i>n</i></strong>g the way you must solve. <strong><i>D</i></strong>iving further will result in new and more difficult ch<strong><i>a</i></strong>llenges, <strong><i>b</i></strong>ut you must meet the assigned tasks or risk termination. You enter with your team and not all of you are guaranteed to <strong>l</strong>eave. And remember, you ar<strong><i>e</i></strong> not alone. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DOC appreciates your efforts and expects success. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Summary Feature List</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to four player coop </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity voice chat and intercom system </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully procedural level generation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smart AI Director to ease frustrations and tune engagement </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight back and outplay the distinct AI   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the seemingly infinite depths of the facility</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save/Load system</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your team</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form a team of up to four total people or play solo. The team shares an increasing and evolving task list as the missions progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962340/extras/ac802c9183f7184d56b0963ef4fab20c.poster.avif?t=1788012957\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962340/extras/ac802c9183f7184d56b0963ef4fab20c.webm?t=1788012957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962340/extras/ac802c9183f7184d56b0963ef4fab20c.mp4?t=1788012957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Complete your task list</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete your randomly generated and ever growing task list to progress to the next floor. DOC expects full completion before allowing you to progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962340/extras/bac87166a81ef7b55ddc1aef8ddf10e5.poster.avif?t=1788012957\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962340/extras/bac87166a81ef7b55ddc1aef8ddf10e5.webm?t=1788012957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962340/extras/bac87166a81ef7b55ddc1aef8ddf10e5.mp4?t=1788012957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Communication is key</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize the proximity voice chat and a wide range of emotes. Utilize the intercom system to keep everyone in the mission in sync no matter where they are. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore new environments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The missions you explore are unique and vast. Room layouts, connections, contents, and scrap are all procedurally generated using an advanced algorithm to make the space believable and more compact. These can be built reliably using seeds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962340/extras/1c8e4ee4eb762ed90d51276b632d1a1a.poster.avif?t=1788012957\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962340/extras/1c8e4ee4eb762ed90d51276b632d1a1a.webm?t=1788012957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962340/extras/1c8e4ee4eb762ed90d51276b632d1a1a.mp4?t=1788012957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Balance your power usage</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power not only provides you with light, but it is also your currency. Scrap items you find to gain power, and spend your power to gain personal or team upgrades. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962340/extras/3df6a241ef861510cc4c712c458cdaf8.poster.avif?t=1788012957\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962340/extras/3df6a241ef861510cc4c712c458cdaf8.webm?t=1788012957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962340/extras/3df6a241ef861510cc4c712c458cdaf8.mp4?t=1788012957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade your base and experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An upgrade system exists  that allows you to dynamically change how any level is played. Radar, item value, inventory capacity, storage capacity and more can be upgraded via choices made in each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962340/extras/168e29b25e8e36ef871579d9da4c4978.poster.avif?t=1788012957\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962340/extras/168e29b25e8e36ef871579d9da4c4978.webm?t=1788012957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962340/extras/168e29b25e8e36ef871579d9da4c4978.mp4?t=1788012957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You are not alone</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An advanced AI Director will navigate the threat-level AI around your location, while also offering a break to those frequented by the AI. Fear is the goal, not frustration. Find hiding spots around your environment and avoid making too much noise. Most AI have unique counters to help prevent death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You are not the only one with good ears</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you hear something make noise, the AI can most likely hear it too. Be careful about making too much noise. Crouch or walk, but run at your own risk. You are NOT the fastest entity present. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight back</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The items you find can be used to negate the AI threat. But be mindful: You will not be able to kill any of the AI. They are always a threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962340/extras/bcc4dbc3bd1e506524e5aefbcf1a3750.poster.avif?t=1788012957\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962340/extras/bcc4dbc3bd1e506524e5aefbcf1a3750.webm?t=1788012957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962340/extras/bcc4dbc3bd1e506524e5aefbcf1a3750.mp4?t=1788012957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Save your progress</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every play through can be saved and reloaded for a cost. Find the floppy discs in each level to save your progress or scrap them for power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962340/extras/dd8f7b62d85111e6c38d6b4942cb320b.poster.avif?t=1788012957\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962340/extras/dd8f7b62d85111e6c38d6b4942cb320b.webm?t=1788012957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962340/extras/dd8f7b62d85111e6c38d6b4942cb320b.mp4?t=1788012957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Async Mission Loading</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The experience is continuous once you have entered the main base. Each mission is loaded asynchronously to offer a fluid experience.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Message from DOC</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Y</i></strong>ou are an employee <strong><i>o</i></strong>f the Department of Collections. Yo<strong><i>u</i></strong> <strong><i>a</i></strong>re required to complete tasks in orde<strong><i>r</i></strong> to progr<strong><i>e</i></strong>ss. Along the way you will find scraps and unique items to help you on your mission, v<strong><i>e</i></strong>ry little will be provided to you by DOC. Everything must be earned and we e<strong><i>x</i></strong>pect com<strong><i>p</i></strong>lianc<strong><i>e</i></strong>.  You'll find puzzles alo<strong><i>n</i></strong>g the way you must solve. <strong><i>D</i></strong>iving further will result in new and more difficult ch<strong><i>a</i></strong>llenges, <strong><i>b</i></strong>ut you must meet the assigned tasks or risk termination. You enter with your team and not all of you are guaranteed to <strong>l</strong>eave. And remember, you ar<strong><i>e</i></strong> not alone. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DOC appreciates your efforts and expects success. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Summary Feature List</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to four player coop </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity voice chat and intercom system </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully procedural level generation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smart AI Director to ease frustrations and tune engagement </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight back and outplay the distinct AI   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the seemingly infinite depths of the facility</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save/Load system</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your team</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form a team of up to four total people or play solo. The team shares an increasing and evolving task list as the missions progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962340/extras/ac802c9183f7184d56b0963ef4fab20c.poster.avif?t=1788012957\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962340/extras/ac802c9183f7184d56b0963ef4fab20c.webm?t=1788012957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962340/extras/ac802c9183f7184d56b0963ef4fab20c.mp4?t=1788012957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Complete your task list</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete your randomly generated and ever growing task list to progress to the next floor. DOC expects full completion before allowing you to progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962340/extras/bac87166a81ef7b55ddc1aef8ddf10e5.poster.avif?t=1788012957\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962340/extras/bac87166a81ef7b55ddc1aef8ddf10e5.webm?t=1788012957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962340/extras/bac87166a81ef7b55ddc1aef8ddf10e5.mp4?t=1788012957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Communication is key</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize the proximity voice chat and a wide range of emotes. Utilize the intercom system to keep everyone in the mission in sync no matter where they are. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore new environments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The missions you explore are unique and vast. Room layouts, connections, contents, and scrap are all procedurally generated using an advanced algorithm to make the space believable and more compact. These can be built reliably using seeds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962340/extras/1c8e4ee4eb762ed90d51276b632d1a1a.poster.avif?t=1788012957\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962340/extras/1c8e4ee4eb762ed90d51276b632d1a1a.webm?t=1788012957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962340/extras/1c8e4ee4eb762ed90d51276b632d1a1a.mp4?t=1788012957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Balance your power usage</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power not only provides you with light, but it is also your currency. Scrap items you find to gain power, and spend your power to gain personal or team upgrades. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962340/extras/3df6a241ef861510cc4c712c458cdaf8.poster.avif?t=1788012957\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962340/extras/3df6a241ef861510cc4c712c458cdaf8.webm?t=1788012957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=v