g>Fight back</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The items you find can be used to negate the AI threat. But be mindful: You will not be able to kill any of the AI. They are always a threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962340/extras/bcc4dbc3bd1e506524e5aefbcf1a3750.poster.avif?t=1788012957\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962340/extras/bcc4dbc3bd1e506524e5aefbcf1a3750.webm?t=1788012957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962340/extras/bcc4dbc3bd1e506524e5aefbcf1a3750.mp4?t=1788012957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Save your progress</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every play through can be saved and reloaded for a cost. Find the floppy discs in each level to save your progress or scrap them for power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962340/extras/dd8f7b62d85111e6c38d6b4942cb320b.poster.avif?t=1788012957\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962340/extras/dd8f7b62d85111e6c38d6b4942cb320b.webm?t=1788012957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962340/extras/dd8f7b62d85111e6c38d6b4942cb320b.mp4?t=1788012957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Async Mission Loading</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The experience is continuous once you have entered the main base. Each mission is loaded asynchronously to offer a fluid experience.</p>", "short_description": "A tasked based fully procedural online co-op sci-fi horror game that can be played both casually or more hardcore. Descend further into the facility using the elevator to discover truths about the facility while avoiding hazards and threats and completing tasks for the Department.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962340/ae249d534e81a64d84a178a4855022912786bbeb/header.jpg?t=1788012957", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962340/9d34ab6a2fae9ae2ecf8340eee24738d9b36bdc5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788012957", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962340/9d34ab6a2fae9ae2ecf8340eee24738d9b36bdc5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788012957", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7400 CPU @ 3.00 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce 1060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Rec